{"id":"dd3ac967350e3362","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible.md","title":"HilbertCompatible","display":"HilbertCompatible","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HilbertCompatible","parameters":["A","R","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HilbertCompatible"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>A</span><span>R</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：参数化 Hilbert 演算。有序参数：<code>A</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HilbertCompatible A R v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ HilbertParams A R)\n  (and\n    (@ CVal v)\n    (and\n      (forall a (implies (in a A) (@ CSat v a)))\n      (forall P\n        (forall a\n          (implies\n            (@ App R P a)\n            (implies\n              (exists n (and (@ Seq P n) (forall i (implies (in i n) (exists b (and (@ App P i b) (@ CSat v b)))))))\n              (@ CSat v a))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4fee39837eb328bf\" href=\"?note=4fee39837eb328bf\" title=\"ZFC_CSat\">CSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"524a355b32bd98f2\" href=\"?note=524a355b32bd98f2\" title=\"ZFC_CVal\">CVal</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"558cfa8109ae83cc\" href=\"?note=558cfa8109ae83cc\" title=\"ZFC_HilbertParams\">HilbertParams</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HilbertCompatible A R v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CSat","status":"resolved","id":"4fee39837eb328bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CVal","status":"resolved","id":"524a355b32bd98f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HilbertParams","status":"resolved","id":"558cfa8109ae83cc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","status":"resolved","id":"ae1f2bbcc1dff983","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc8424d7afc22e4d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-740","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]"},{"id":"0c6fbc9920c55fb6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","4fee39837eb328bf","524a355b32bd98f2","558cfa8109ae83cc","ae1f2bbcc1dff983","593f9bdab4d60707"]}